      "id": "0199bb21-24bb-75f8-92ca-d2fa14886d7c",
      "title": "Heron spotting at Lake Merritt",
      "content": "Saturday March 8, 2025. Got to Lake Merritt at 7:15 am, before the joggers. A great blue heron was standing in the shallows near the boathouse for almost twenty minutes, perfectly still, then caught a fish and flew off toward the Rotary Nature Center. Maria met me there with the good camera. Want to go back in April when the nesting starts.",
      "userId": "0198f0aa-3b52-7c10-8e2d-6a9f01c4d377",
